中，不扶自直；白沙在泥中，與之皆黑」者，土地教化使之然也。其後胥復祝詛謀反，自殺，國除。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-060-sanwang:m027-0092"]}],"rationale":"按明示奏議署稱、封策、三王敘事與局部帝稱暫接；光與安依職事先分候選，單名不補姓。王夫人閎母與三王子嗣依來源所見稱謂，請議與實授、指控與史實分辨，原文及傳承限制保留。 p026明記「宣帝初立」及本始元年封廣陵王胥子；p027承以「其後胥果作威福」，繼記天子因骨肉不忍致法，故此處「天子」仍指宣帝。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:p026","text":"會昭帝崩，宣帝初立，緣恩行義，以本始元年中，裂漢地，盡以封廣陵王胥四子：一子為朝陽侯；一子為平曲侯；一子為南利侯；最愛少子弘，立以為高密王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"昭帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAAE","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"宣帝","kind":"person","person_id":"xkc_rp5_a3d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0029","start":29,"end":33,"surface":"廣陵王胥","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"四子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、制度泛稱、祖先或未定指代；不補未見姓名、成員或確定親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0039","start":39,"end":42,"surface":"朝陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"平曲侯","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAACB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0053","start":53,"end":56,"surface":"南利侯","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAACC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0061","start":61,"end":62,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAACD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0066","start":66,"end":69,"surface":"高密王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAACD","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang"